  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 67d1209b8a5607f47ae93622f47c9c71, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dialogueLines:
  - 'J.: Billy?'
  - "Billy.: *exhaling smoke* : Who the hell are you? How do you know my name? Did
    the principal send you? And\u2014wait\u2026 how can you even see me?\n"
  - "J.: I talked to Josh. He figured you\u2019d probably be hiding here. I\u2019m
    trying to escape this place.\n"
  - "Billy: Josh? You mean Chad\u2019s little brown-nosing sidekick? Damn. So he\u2019s
    still alive?  *takes a long hit from his vape*\n"
  - "J.: Not exactly. He\u2019s\u2026 dead. He just doesn\u2019t know it yet. He
    said you stole a scroll from the principal.\n"
  - "Billy.: Oh, that thing? Yeah\u2026 well, it ripped in half during the chase.
    My friends\u2014Chad and Maddison\u2014each grabbed a piece.\n"
  - "J.: You wouldn\u2019t happen to know where they ran off to, would you?\n"
  - "Billy: If I had to guess, she's in the girl's bathroom. That's where she always
    is during class. And if she\u2019s smart, she\u2019s holed up in there.\n"
  - 'J.: And Chad?

'
  - 'Billy: Chad? Pfft. If I had to bet, he ran to the gym. That dude practically
    lives there. *hits his vape*'
